Package: sciencekitr
Type: Package
Title: R Bindings for the 'sciencekit' Machine-Learning Library
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("sciencekit", "contributors", email = "maintainers@neurono.ml", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: sciencekit contributors [aut, cre]
Maintainer: sciencekit contributors <maintainers@neurono.ml>
Description: Idiomatic R bindings over the stable 'sciencekit_ffi' C ABI. Provides
    external-pointer handles with automatic finalizers and idempotent 'close()'
    methods, strict double-precision ('f64') dense matrix conversion, fitting,
    prediction, transformation, scoring, model persistence, and structured
    'sciencekit_error' conditions carrying native ABI status codes.
License: Apache License (>= 2.0)
URL: https://github.com/neurono-ml/sciencekit-r, https://neurono-ml.github.io/sciencekit-r/
BugReports: https://github.com/neurono-ml/sciencekit-r/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: stats
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
SystemRequirements: Prebuilt static library 'libsciencekit_ffi.a' from 'neurono-ml/sciencekit' (built via 'scripts/build-native-library.sh').
NeedsCompilation: yes
